+# DeepSeek-V4 JIT kernel sources in this starting tree
+
+This directory holds the DeepSeek-V4 JIT kernel sources supplied with the task. The sources of these
+operations are not supplied, and implementing them is part of the task:
+
+| Missing source | Python entry point in `python/sglang/jit_kernel/deepseek_v4.py` |
+|---|---|
+| `c4.cuh`, `c128.cuh` | `compress_forward` (C4 and C128 compression) |
+| `fused_norm_rope.cuh` | `compress_fused_norm_rope_inplace` |
+| `store.cuh` | `fused_store_cache` |
+| `c128_v2.cuh`, `c128_online.cuh` | alternate C128 modes that the task does not require |
+
+The Python entry points and their signatures are kept, and the module imports. Calling one of them
+before its source exists fails when its JIT build cannot find the file. The operations are specified in
+`/app/eval/deepseek_v4_flash/kernels/README.md`. The other sources here (planning, RMSNorm, RoPE, top-k,
+indexer metadata, MoE and quantization helpers) are supplied and usable.
diff --git a/python/sglang/jit_kernel/csrc/deepseek_v4/common.cuh b/python/sglang/jit_kernel/csrc/deepseek_v4/common.cuh
